  "description": {
   "en": "Itsuki Fukunaga (27) is the manager of a reptile store. Surrounded by his favorite reptiles, he spent every day happily. But one day, one of the lizards, a bearded dragon named Fuu-chan, turned into a human girl. Her personality and gestures are the same as when she was a reptile.\n___\n**Links:**\n- Alternative Official Raw - [Kadocomi](https://comic-walker.com/detail/KC_002284_S)\n- Alternative Official Raw - [Nico Nico Seiga](https://sp.seiga.nicovideo.jp/comic/66778)",
   "ja": "大好きな爬虫類が大の苦手な女の子になってしまった！！\n\n福永いつき（27）は爬虫類ショップの店長。大好きな爬虫類たちに囲まれて毎日幸せに過ごしていた。ある日、フトアゴヒゲトカゲのふぅちゃんが人間の女の子になってしまって…！？ごはんにおふろに…脱皮！？"
  },
